<div class="wd-block" data-line="0" data-end-line="5" data-key="2d8upfxgq4n8h">
  <header class="wd-frontmatter">
    <div class="wd-frontmatter-meta">
      <ul class="wd-tags">
        <li class="wd-tag">#markdown</li>
        <li class="wd-tag">#gfm</li>
        <li class="wd-tag">#reference</li>
      </ul>
      <span class="wd-frontmatter-info">Version 1.0.0</span>
      <span class="wd-frontmatter-info">Backtickle</span>
    </div>
  </header>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="7" data-end-line="7" data-key="54av0d9v5y18">
  <h1 id="markdown-guide">Markdown Guide</h1>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="9" data-end-line="9" data-key="ihbznmdh6f6n">
  <p>This guide shows you the Markdown syntax supported by Backtickle for GitHub Flavored Markdown (GFM). Each feature has one section: a short description, the Markdown source in a code block, and the rendered result directly below it.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="11" data-end-line="11" data-key="27l9tbf7lepw">
  <h2 id="headings">Headings</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="13" data-end-line="13" data-key="1g58hjit5ag4c">
  <p>Six heading levels are available. The source shows all six; the rendered result shows levels 3 to 6 only, so the outline of this guide stays intact.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="15" data-end-line="22" data-key="hlialdb8so8j">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown"><span class="tok-heading tok-meta">#</span><span class="tok-heading"> Heading 1</span>
<span class="tok-heading tok-meta">##</span><span class="tok-heading"> Heading 2</span>
<span class="tok-heading tok-meta">###</span><span class="tok-heading"> Heading 3</span>
<span class="tok-heading tok-meta">####</span><span class="tok-heading"> Heading 4</span>
<span class="tok-heading tok-meta">#####</span><span class="tok-heading"> Heading 5</span>
<span class="tok-heading tok-meta">######</span><span class="tok-heading"> Heading 6</span>
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="24" data-end-line="24" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="26" data-end-line="26" data-key="lou79an59my">
  <h3 id="heading-3">Heading 3</h3>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="27" data-end-line="27" data-key="b3i357lc61y">
  <h4 id="heading-4">Heading 4</h4>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="28" data-end-line="28" data-key="237d4lynrogy">
  <h5 id="heading-5">Heading 5</h5>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="29" data-end-line="29" data-key="asogl7mobny">
  <h6 id="heading-6">Heading 6</h6>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="31" data-end-line="31" data-key="1u115r0d1os24">
  <h2 id="paragraphs-and-text-formatting">Paragraphs and text formatting</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="33" data-end-line="33" data-key="19bjwtbu8ct2j">
  <p>Use asterisks for emphasis, tildes for strikethrough and backticks for inline code.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="35" data-end-line="38" data-key="12ol4bicb0ba4">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown">This is a simple paragraph with <span class="tok-emphasis tok-meta">*</span><span class="tok-emphasis">italic text</span><span class="tok-emphasis tok-meta">*</span>, <span class="tok-strong tok-meta">**</span><span class="tok-strong">bold text</span><span class="tok-strong tok-meta">**</span>, and <span class="tok-emphasis tok-meta">*</span><span class="tok-emphasis tok-strong tok-meta">**</span><span class="tok-emphasis tok-strong">bold italic text</span><span class="tok-emphasis tok-strong tok-meta">**</span><span class="tok-emphasis tok-meta">*</span>.
You can also use ~~strikethrough~~ and <span class="tok-meta">`</span>inline code<span class="tok-meta">`</span>.
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="40" data-end-line="40" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="42" data-end-line="43" data-key="1fr1mazh2xc5t">
  <p>This is a simple paragraph with <em>italic text</em>, <strong>bold text</strong>, and <em><strong>bold italic text</strong></em>.
You can also use <del>strikethrough</del> and <code>inline code</code>.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="45" data-end-line="45" data-key="1wgcbzu82gfq">
  <h2 id="links">Links</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="47" data-end-line="47" data-key="emzjmdt9fc2u">
  <p>Links can be inline, point to a heading in the same document, or be written as bare autolinks.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="49" data-end-line="53" data-key="xxdf70wftj97">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown"><span class="tok-link tok-meta">[</span><span class="tok-link">External link to example.org</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">]</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">(</span><span class="tok-link tok-url">https://example.org</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">)</span>
<span class="tok-link tok-meta">[</span><span class="tok-link">Link to a heading</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">]</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">(</span><span class="tok-link tok-url">#headings</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">)</span>
<span class="tok-meta">&lt;</span><span class="tok-url">https://example.org</span><span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span>
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="55" data-end-line="55" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="57" data-end-line="59" data-key="58n8eu7s9l4m">
  <p><a href="https://example.org">External link to example.org</a>
<a href="#headings">Link to a heading</a>
<a href="https://example.org">https://example.org</a></p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="61" data-end-line="61" data-key="20zofyhayhks">
  <h2 id="images">Images</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="63" data-end-line="63" data-key="13us64gv5po37">
  <p>Images use the link syntax with a leading exclamation mark. This one is a small PNG embedded as a data URI.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="65" data-end-line="67" data-key="13npgln88wc9y">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown"><span class="tok-link tok-meta">![</span><span class="tok-link">Sample PNG</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">]</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">(</span><span class="tok-link tok-url">data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAgAAAAICAIAAABLbSncAAAAEUlEQVR4nGNImXYCK2IYWhIA3E1wgc0lMTEAAAAASUVORK5CYII=</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">)</span>
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="69" data-end-line="69" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="71" data-end-line="71" data-key="1613hlgwxp4f">
  <p><img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAgAAAAICAIAAABLbSncAAAAEUlEQVR4nGNImXYCK2IYWhIA3E1wgc0lMTEAAAAASUVORK5CYII=" alt="Sample PNG" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="73" data-end-line="73" data-key="ixa42snirw12">
  <h2 id="blockquotes">Blockquotes</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="75" data-end-line="75" data-key="2dtgwtsdy5k28">
  <p>Start a line with a greater-than sign to quote it. Quotes can be nested.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="77" data-end-line="82" data-key="qb8eyf9ckv95">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown"><span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span> This is a blockquote.
<span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span>
<span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span> <span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span> This is a nested blockquote.
<span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span> <span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span> It can have multiple lines.
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="84" data-end-line="84" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="86" data-end-line="89" data-key="s257b5o02k43">
  <blockquote>
    <p>This is a blockquote.</p>
    <blockquote>
      <p>This is a nested blockquote.
It can have multiple lines.</p>
    </blockquote>
  </blockquote>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="91" data-end-line="91" data-key="78kzdwi4a016">
  <h2 id="github-alerts">GitHub Alerts</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="93" data-end-line="93" data-key="28ri9apjisu2a">
  <p>Five alert types are supported: note, tip, important, warning and caution.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="95" data-end-line="110" data-key="o9p6zklez4gf">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown"><span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span> <span class="tok-link tok-meta">[</span><span class="tok-link">!NOTE</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">]</span>
<span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span> Highlights information that users should take into account.

<span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span> <span class="tok-link tok-meta">[</span><span class="tok-link">!TIP</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">]</span>
<span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span> Optional information to help a user be more successful.

<span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span> <span class="tok-link tok-meta">[</span><span class="tok-link">!IMPORTANT</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">]</span>
<span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span> Crucial information necessary for users to succeed.

<span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span> <span class="tok-link tok-meta">[</span><span class="tok-link">!WARNING</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">]</span>
<span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span> Critical content demanding immediate user attention.

<span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span> <span class="tok-link tok-meta">[</span><span class="tok-link">!CAUTION</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">]</span>
<span class="tok-meta">&gt;</span> Negative potential consequences of an action.
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="112" data-end-line="112" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="114" data-end-line="115" data-key="ryb9fa5ymh5e">
  <div class="callout callout-note">
    <p class="callout-title"><span class="callout-icon" data-icon="info"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span>Note</p>
    <p>Highlights information that users should take into account.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="117" data-end-line="118" data-key="1xu6sittueg5d">
  <div class="callout callout-tip">
    <p class="callout-title"><span class="callout-icon" data-icon="lightbulb"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span>Tip</p>
    <p>Optional information to help a user be more successful.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="120" data-end-line="121" data-key="m6wt5ctdzk5i">
  <div class="callout callout-important">
    <p class="callout-title"><span class="callout-icon" data-icon="report"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span>Important</p>
    <p>Crucial information necessary for users to succeed.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="123" data-end-line="124" data-key="1vtjbqww5p65g">
  <div class="callout callout-warning">
    <p class="callout-title"><span class="callout-icon" data-icon="warning"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span>Warning</p>
    <p>Critical content demanding immediate user attention.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="126" data-end-line="127" data-key="1wim86r797857">
  <div class="callout callout-caution">
    <p class="callout-title"><span class="callout-icon" data-icon="error"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span>Caution</p>
    <p>Negative potential consequences of an action.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="129" data-end-line="129" data-key="xq4x7rt8wbq">
  <h2 id="lists">Lists</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="131" data-end-line="131" data-key="8pkjjbfayw1r">
  <p>Unordered and ordered lists can be nested by indenting.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="133" data-end-line="145" data-key="pxxua3lwmmcm">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown"><span class="tok-meta">-</span> Unordered list item 1
<span class="tok-meta">-</span> Unordered list item 2
  <span class="tok-meta">-</span> Nested item 1
  <span class="tok-meta">-</span> Nested item 2
<span class="tok-meta">-</span> Unordered list item 3

<span class="tok-meta">1.</span> Ordered list item 1
<span class="tok-meta">2.</span> Ordered list item 2
   <span class="tok-meta">1.</span> Nested ordered item 1
   <span class="tok-meta">2.</span> Nested ordered item 2
<span class="tok-meta">3.</span> Ordered list item 3
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="147" data-end-line="147" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="149" data-end-line="153" data-key="ajii6t22606l">
  <ul>
    <li data-wd-rl="0" data-line="149">Unordered list item 1</li>
    <li data-wd-rl="1" data-line="150">
      Unordered list item 2
      <ul>
        <li data-wd-rl="2" data-line="151">Nested item 1</li>
        <li data-wd-rl="3" data-line="152">Nested item 2</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li data-wd-rl="4" data-line="153">Unordered list item 3</li>
  </ul>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="155" data-end-line="159" data-key="22uisx4crmo6v">
  <ol>
    <li data-wd-rl="0" data-line="155">Ordered list item 1</li>
    <li data-wd-rl="1" data-line="156">
      Ordered list item 2
      <ol>
        <li data-wd-rl="2" data-line="157">Nested ordered item 1</li>
        <li data-wd-rl="3" data-line="158">Nested ordered item 2</li>
      </ol>
    </li>
    <li data-wd-rl="4" data-line="159">Ordered list item 3</li>
  </ol>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="161" data-end-line="161" data-key="dixfd5yj1210">
  <h2 id="task-lists">Task lists</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="163" data-end-line="163" data-key="n2wtqn4s821z">
  <p>A list item that starts with a bracket pair becomes a checkbox.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="165" data-end-line="171" data-key="27d86wdx3r39t">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown"><span class="tok-meta">-</span> <span class="tok-link tok-meta">[</span><span class="tok-link">x</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">]</span> Completed task
<span class="tok-meta">-</span> [ ] Incomplete task
<span class="tok-meta">-</span> <span class="tok-link tok-meta">[</span><span class="tok-link">x</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">]</span> Another completed task
  <span class="tok-meta">-</span> [ ] Nested incomplete task
  <span class="tok-meta">-</span> <span class="tok-link tok-meta">[</span><span class="tok-link">x</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">]</span> Nested completed task
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="173" data-end-line="173" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="175" data-end-line="179" data-key="2czox89pqjuuu">
  <ul class="contains-task-list">
    <li class="task-list-item is-checked" data-wd-rl="0" data-line="175"><span class="task-checkbox" role="checkbox" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" aria-label="Completed task" data-wd-trl="0" data-task-line="175"></span>Completed task</li>
    <li class="task-list-item" data-wd-rl="1" data-line="176"><span class="task-checkbox" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false" tabindex="0" aria-label="Incomplete task" data-wd-trl="1" data-task-line="176"></span>Incomplete task</li>
    <li class="task-list-item is-checked" data-wd-rl="2" data-line="177">
      <span class="task-checkbox" role="checkbox" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" aria-label="Another completed task" data-wd-trl="2" data-task-line="177"></span>
      Another completed task
      <ul class="contains-task-list">
        <li class="task-list-item" data-wd-rl="3" data-line="178"><span class="task-checkbox" role="checkbox" aria-checked="false" tabindex="0" aria-label="Nested incomplete task" data-wd-trl="3" data-task-line="178"></span>Nested incomplete task</li>
        <li class="task-list-item is-checked" data-wd-rl="4" data-line="179"><span class="task-checkbox" role="checkbox" aria-checked="true" tabindex="0" aria-label="Nested completed task" data-wd-trl="4" data-task-line="179"></span>Nested completed task</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="181" data-end-line="181" data-key="8febefp8n8s">
  <h2 id="tables">Tables</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="183" data-end-line="183" data-key="1pd09u1ydmh1p">
  <p>Colons in the separator row set the column alignment.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="185" data-end-line="190" data-key="gsxmj7pa2bbo">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown">| Left aligned | Center aligned | Right aligned |
| :----------- | :------------: | ------------: |
| L1           | C1             | R1            |
| L2           | C2             | R2            |
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="192" data-end-line="192" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="194" data-end-line="197" data-key="18a247jgad3ci">
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr data-wd-rl="0" data-line="194">
<th class="align-left">Left aligned</th>
<th class="align-center">Center aligned</th>
<th class="align-right">Right aligned</th>
</tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr data-wd-rl="2" data-line="196">
<td class="align-left">L1</td>
<td class="align-center">C1</td>
<td class="align-right">R1</td>
</tr>
      <tr data-wd-rl="3" data-line="197">
<td class="align-left">L2</td>
<td class="align-center">C2</td>
<td class="align-right">R2</td>
</tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="199" data-end-line="199" data-key="7lyu63ajfc12">
  <h2 id="code-blocks">Code blocks</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="201" data-end-line="201" data-key="2vrh0vbkok4w">
  <p>Fence code with three backticks and name the language after the opening fence for highlighting. The source below uses four backticks so the inner fences show literally.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="203" data-end-line="231" data-key="zc68jacqkjhb">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown"><span class="tok-meta">```</span><span class="tok-labelName">typescript</span>
const greeting: string = "Hello, world!";
console.log(greeting);
<span class="tok-meta">```</span>

<span class="tok-meta">```</span><span class="tok-labelName">python</span>
def greet(name):
    print(f"Hello, {name}!")
<span class="tok-meta">```</span>

<span class="tok-meta">```</span><span class="tok-labelName">r</span>
data &lt;- read.csv("file.csv")
summary(data)
<span class="tok-meta">```</span>

<span class="tok-meta">```</span><span class="tok-labelName">sql</span>
SELECT name, email FROM users WHERE active = true;
<span class="tok-meta">```</span>

<span class="tok-meta">```</span><span class="tok-labelName">bash</span>
echo "Hello from bash"
ls -la /home
<span class="tok-meta">```</span>

<span class="tok-meta">```</span>
Plain text code block without a language.
<span class="tok-meta">```</span>
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="233" data-end-line="233" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="235" data-end-line="238" data-key="mm6ztivmqs8d">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="typescript">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">TypeScript</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-typescript"><span class="tok-keyword">const</span> <span class="tok-variableName tok-definition">greeting</span><span class="tok-punctuation">:</span> <span class="tok-typeName">string</span> <span class="tok-operator">=</span> <span class="tok-string">"Hello, world!"</span><span class="tok-punctuation">;</span>
<span class="tok-variableName">console</span><span class="tok-operator">.</span><span class="tok-propertyName">log</span><span class="tok-punctuation">(</span><span class="tok-variableName">greeting</span><span class="tok-punctuation">)</span><span class="tok-punctuation">;</span>
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="240" data-end-line="243" data-key="1gf74opskyo7i">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="python">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Python</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-python"><span class="tok-keyword">def</span> <span class="tok-variableName tok-definition">greet</span><span class="tok-punctuation">(</span><span class="tok-variableName">name</span><span class="tok-punctuation">)</span>:
    <span class="tok-variableName">print</span><span class="tok-punctuation">(</span><span class="tok-string2">f"Hello, </span><span class="tok-punctuation">{</span><span class="tok-variableName">name</span><span class="tok-punctuation">}</span><span class="tok-string2">!"</span><span class="tok-punctuation">)</span>
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="245" data-end-line="248" data-key="244ytkmst3f73">
