<div class="wd-block" data-line="263" data-end-line="263" data-key="hdt50469tq1i">
  <h2 id="indented-code-block">Indented code block</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="265" data-end-line="265" data-key="uwfgsc1kln1m">
  <p>Four spaces of indentation also make a code block.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="267" data-end-line="271" data-key="1im63cyhifd85">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown">    function example() {
        return "indented code";
    }
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="273" data-end-line="273" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="275" data-end-line="277" data-key="yasjqsbfmf6r">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Text</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code>function example() {
    return "indented code";
}
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="279" data-end-line="279" data-key="1dtliefalh6o">
  <h2 id="math">Math</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="281" data-end-line="281" data-key="irynf1esfl3w">
  <p>Use single dollar signs for inline math, double dollar signs for display math, and a <code>math</code> fence for a multi-line block.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="283" data-end-line="298" data-key="d2s3ux624bbc">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown">Inline math: $E = mc^2$

Display math:

$$\int_0^1 x^2<span class="tok-string2">\,</span>dx = \frac{1}{3}$$

Math block:

<span class="tok-meta">```</span><span class="tok-labelName">math</span>
\begin{align}
a^2 + b^2 &amp;= c^2 \\
\sin^2\theta + \cos^2\theta &amp;= 1
\end{align}
<span class="tok-meta">```</span>
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="300" data-end-line="300" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="302" data-end-line="302" data-key="1u5vzz31b9h2f">
  <p>Inline math: <span class="math math-inline math-rendered" data-tex="E = mc^2"><span class="katex"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E = mc^2</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="304" data-end-line="304" data-key="1byminejjbql">
  <p>Display math:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="306" data-end-line="306" data-key="mxllbz1d1x32">
  <div class="math math-display math-rendered" data-tex="\int_0^1 x^2\,dx = \frac{1}{3}"><span class="katex"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\int_0^1 x^2\,dx = \frac{1}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span></div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="308" data-end-line="308" data-key="253avffjqsmj">
  <p>Math block:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="310" data-end-line="315" data-key="2gkdvina9pa66">
  <div class="math math-display math-rendered" data-tex="\begin{align}
a^2 + b^2 &amp;= c^2 \\
\sin^2\theta + \cos^2\theta &amp;= 1
\end{align}"><span class="katex"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mtable rowspacing="0.25em" columnalign="right left" columnspacing="0em"><mtr><mtd class="mtr-glue"></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd class="mtr-glue"></mtd><mtd class="mml-eqn-num"></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="mtr-glue"></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel="0" displaystyle="true"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd class="mtr-glue"></mtd><mtd class="mml-eqn-num"></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\begin{align}
a^2 + b^2 &amp;= c^2 \\
\sin^2\theta + \cos^2\theta &amp;= 1
\end{align}</annotation></semantics></math></span></div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="317" data-end-line="317" data-key="20e5nzjqghhq">
  <h2 id="emoji">Emoji</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="319" data-end-line="319" data-key="133ldlrh7801s">
  <p>Emoji shortcodes are replaced by the matching character.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="321" data-end-line="323" data-key="x2eplzbnhb84">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown">You can use emoji shortcodes like :tada: and :rocket: in your Markdown.
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="325" data-end-line="325" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="327" data-end-line="327" data-key="1gu5kdi4tnv1x">
  <p>You can use emoji shortcodes like 🎉 and 🚀 in your Markdown.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="329" data-end-line="329" data-key="13wsc8e6a8uy">
  <h2 id="footnotes">Footnotes</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="331" data-end-line="331" data-key="fqhtnyp6j2r">
  <p>A footnote reference points to a definition, which is collected at the end of the document.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="333" data-end-line="340" data-key="41iz6auy8hb9">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown">This is a statement with a footnote<span class="tok-link tok-meta">[</span><span class="tok-link">^1</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">]</span>.

Here is another footnote reference<span class="tok-link tok-meta">[</span><span class="tok-link">^2</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">]</span>.

<span class="tok-link tok-meta">[</span><span class="tok-link">^1</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">]</span>: This is the first footnote content.
<span class="tok-link tok-meta">[</span><span class="tok-link">^2</span><span class="tok-link tok-meta">]</span>: This is the second footnote content with more detail.
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="342" data-end-line="342" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="344" data-end-line="344" data-key="lfgknx3r6e32">
  <p>This is a statement with a footnote<sup class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn1" id="fnref1">[1]</a></sup>.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="346" data-end-line="346" data-key="517zruauu931">
  <p>Here is another footnote reference<sup class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn2" id="fnref2">[2]</a></sup>.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="351" data-end-line="351" data-key="ijkf5fqc1b1a">
  <h2 id="horizontal-rule">Horizontal rule</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="353" data-end-line="353" data-key="r158avejdv1g">
  <p>Three hyphens on their own line draw a rule.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="355" data-end-line="357" data-key="1wpqnfenjdt68">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown">---
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="359" data-end-line="359" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="361" data-end-line="361" data-key="kvowox25nn5"><hr>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="363" data-end-line="363" data-key="21a7m9pq0pzw">
  <h2 id="raw-html">Raw HTML</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="365" data-end-line="365" data-key="1th2upqelwb2k">
  <p>Safe HTML elements are allowed and rendered. Scripts and event handlers are removed.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="367" data-end-line="372" data-key="rl5l0k07rv9l">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown"><span class="tok-punctuation">&lt;</span><span class="tok-typeName">details</span><span class="tok-punctuation">&gt;</span>
<span class="tok-punctuation">&lt;</span><span class="tok-typeName">summary</span><span class="tok-punctuation">&gt;</span>Click to expand<span class="tok-punctuation">&lt;/</span><span class="tok-typeName">summary</span><span class="tok-punctuation">&gt;</span>
This is hidden content that can be expanded.
<span class="tok-punctuation">&lt;/</span><span class="tok-typeName">details</span><span class="tok-punctuation">&gt;</span>
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="374" data-end-line="374" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="376" data-end-line="379" data-key="26yqzgyrhyq2t">
  <details>
<summary>Click to expand</summary>
This is hidden content that can be expanded.
</details>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="381" data-end-line="381" data-key="7fssyh0al212">
  <h2 id="line-breaks">Line breaks</h2>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="383" data-end-line="383" data-key="1jzhlmb3ftm20">
  <p>End a line with two spaces or a backslash to force a line break.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="385" data-end-line="391" data-key="124x7z7r0qia5">
  <div class="code-card" data-lang="markdown">
    <div class="code-card-header"><span class="code-card-lang">Markdown</span><span class="code-card-actions"><button type="button" class="code-copy"><span class="code-copy-icon"><svg viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="13" height="13" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">...</svg></span><span class="code-copy-label">Copy</span></button></span></div>
    <pre tabindex="0"><code class="language-markdown">This line has two trailing spaces at the end<span class="tok-meta">  </span>
and continues on the next line.

This line uses a backslash<span class="tok-meta">\</span>
and also continues on the next line.
</code></pre>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="393" data-end-line="393" data-key="zo5553fekhf">
  <p>Result:</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="395" data-end-line="396" data-key="1nt46wz1xos2g">
  <p>This line has two trailing spaces at the end<br>
and continues on the next line.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="398" data-end-line="399" data-key="b9qk0ul39223">
  <p>This line uses a backslash<br>
and also continues on the next line.</p>
</div>
<div class="wd-block" data-line="348" data-end-line="349" data-key="27u875jpo8uaq">
  <hr class="footnotes-sep">
  <section class="footnotes">
    <ol class="footnotes-list">
      <li id="fn1" class="footnote-item">
        <p>This is the first footnote content. <a href="#fnref1" class="footnote-backref">↩︎</a></p>
      </li>
      <li id="fn2" class="footnote-item">
        <p>This is the second footnote content with more detail. <a href="#fnref2" class="footnote-backref">↩︎</a></p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</div>
